---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Levelled Media"
  description="How Levelled Media collects, uses and protects your personal data."
  pageStyles={`
    .legal-content {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding-top: 64px;
      padding-bottom: 96px;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin: 40px 0 12px;
    }

    .legal-content h2:first-child {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .legal-content p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--body-text);
      margin: 0 0 16px;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .legal-content li {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--body-text);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .legal-content a {
      color: var(--dark);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }

  `}
>
  <section class="hero-section hero-section--compact" id="hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner hero-inner--centered">
      <h1 class="hero-title fade-up">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle fade-up">How we collect, use and protect your personal data.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-content">
    <div class="container">

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Levelled Media ("we", "us", "our") builds websites and provides local SEO services for local
        service businesses. This policy explains what personal data we collect through
        levelledmedia.com, why we collect it, and what rights you have over it.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>We collect personal data you give us directly, such as when you:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Fill in a contact or "free website" enquiry form (name, business name, email, phone number, website URL, and any message you enter)</li>
        <li>Book a call through our scheduling widget (name, email, phone number, and the time zone/slot you select)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We also collect limited technical data automatically when you browse the site, such as pages
        visited and general interaction data, via the tools described below.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your enquiry and discuss our services</li>
        <li>To schedule and manage calls you book with us</li>
        <li>To measure how our marketing is performing and improve it</li>
        <li>To meet our legal and accounting obligations</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your personal data.</p>

      <h2>Third parties we use</h2>
      <p>We share data with a small number of service providers who process it on our behalf:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>GoHighLevel / LeadConnector</strong> — powers our contact forms and call-booking widget, and stores enquiry details in our CRM</li>
        <li><strong>Meta (Facebook) Pixel</strong> — measures ad performance and site visits for our marketing; this sets cookies in your browser, which you can block in your browser settings</li>
        <li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong> — hosts this website and may log standard technical data (such as IP address) as part of normal web hosting</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep enquiry and booking data for as long as needed to respond to you, deliver our services,
        and meet legal or accounting requirements, after which it is deleted or anonymised.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under UK GDPR, you can ask us to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
        <li>Correct inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Delete your data</li>
        <li>Restrict or object to how we use it</li>
        <li>Receive a copy of your data in a portable format</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To exercise any of these rights, contact us using the details below. You can also complain to
        the UK Information Commissioner's Office (ico.org.uk) if you're unhappy with how we handle
        your data.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>Our services are aimed at businesses, not children. We do not knowingly collect data from anyone under 16.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date above shows when it last changed.</p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        For any privacy questions or to exercise your rights, email us at
        <span id="privacy-email-slot">lewis[at]levelledmedia[dot]com</span>.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    const el = document.getElementById('privacy-email-slot');
    if (el) {
      const user = 'lewis';
      const domain = 'levelledmedia.com';
      const link = document.createElement('a');
      link.href = `mailto:${user}@${domain}`;
      link.textContent = `${user}@${domain}`;
      el.replaceWith(link);
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
